  triage:title "atm-daemon-bootstrap lib tests do not compile: start_replacement_runtime_for_test missing and E0282 type annotations in the AW.3 test module" ;
  triage:description "PR #1182 CI Clippy and Just lint (run 33944237975 at 35a764539, still present locally at a046246c3): cargo check --tests -p atm-daemon-bootstrap fails with E0425 cannot find function start_replacement_runtime_for_test (crates/atm-daemon-bootstrap/src/lib.rs:914) and E0282 type annotations needed (lib.rs:1317, lib.rs:1334), plus unused import start_replacement_runtime. The AW3-CI-002 rewiring of start_replacement_runtime removed or renamed the test-only constructor without updating its callers. Fix: restore or rename the test helper and annotate the two inferred bindings; verify with cargo clippy --all-targets -p atm-daemon-bootstrap." ;
